{"seq":2,"slug":"causal-interventions","title":"因果干预：改动激活，追踪信息流向","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/chain-of-thought-faithfulness/measurement/causal-interventions","wordCount":1583,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"因果干预-改动激活-追踪信息流向\">因果干预：改动激活，追踪信息流向</h1><p>扰动测试改的是推理链的文字，因果干预改的是模型内部的激活——这一字之差，把证据的层次从&quot;行为&quot;提升到了&quot;机制&quot;。当一段推理链换成填充符号答案却不变时，扰动测试只能耸耸肩说&quot;文字大概没在驱动答案&quot;，却说不清真正的计算到底走了哪条路。因果干预能回答这个问题：它借助机制可解释性的手术刀，直接在模型的前向计算里做对照实验，判定推理链中的某一步到底有没有把信息传递给最终答案。这是本 hub 与 <a href=\"../../mechanistic-interpretability/foundations/what-is-mech-interp\">机制可解释性</a> 交汇最深的一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从相关到因果\">核心概念：从相关到因果</h2><p>扰动测试面临一个根本的推断难题。观察到&quot;改动推理 A 时答案变了&quot;只能建立相关，不能排除混淆——也许是改动 A 时顺带改变了别的东西。因果推断的标准解法是干预：主动、精确地只改变一个变量，把其余固定住，看结果是否变化。在神经网络里，这意味着不去改文字，而是直接改写某一层、某一位置的激活向量，再让前向计算继续跑完，观察输出。</p>\n<p>形式上，设模型某位置的激活为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，最终答案对应的 logit 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。因果干预把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 替换为某个对照值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（来自另一道题或某种基线），度量输出的变化量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = y(h \\to h&#x27;) - y(h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，说明该位置的激活对答案的因果影响越强。把这个操作施加在&quot;承载推理某一步&quot;的位置上，就能判定这一步是否真的驱动了答案——而这正是忠实性的机制层定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种主流干预手段\">三种主流干预手段</h2><p>因果干预不是单一技术，而是一族方法，按&quot;改什么、怎么改&quot;区分。它们的底层实现都属于机制可解释性工具箱，本篇只讲它们如何被借来测忠实性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>测量什么</th>\n<th>对忠实性的用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>激活补丁</td>\n<td>用另一输入的激活替换本输入的某位置</td>\n<td>该位置对输出的因果贡献</td>\n<td>判定推理某步是否驱动答案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果中介分析</td>\n<td>分解直接效应与经由中介的间接效应</td>\n<td>信息是否经推理链传导</td>\n<td>区分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\to r\\to y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\to y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 旁路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因补丁</td>\n<td>用梯度近似大规模补丁效应</td>\n<td>全层位置的影响热图</td>\n<td>规模化定位真实计算路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>激活补丁是其中最直接的：它回答&quot;如果把这一步的内部表示换掉，答案会不会变&quot;。因果中介分析更进一步，它把总效应拆成两条路——一条经由推理链传导（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\to r \\to y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>），一条绕过推理链直达答案（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\to y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>）。如果绝大部分效应走的是旁路，那就从机制上坐实了事后合理化：推理链是并行旁白而非因果主干。激活补丁的技术细节见 <a href=\"../../mechanistic-interpretability/methods/activation-patching\">机制可解释性 · 激活补丁</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一次因果中介实验的结构\">一次因果中介实验的结构</h2><p>下图展示如何用因果中介分析判定一段推理是否忠实。核心是构造两条竞争路径，度量各自承载了多少效应。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[输入含关键因素 X] --&gt; B[前向计算至推理链位置]&#10;  B --&gt; C[推理链激活 h_r]&#10;  A --&gt; D[旁路: X 直接影响后层]&#10;  C --&gt; E[最终答案 logit y]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  F[干预: 把 h_r 替换为对照值] --&gt; C&#10;  E --&gt; G{y 变化大吗?}&#10;  G --&gt;|变化大| H[效应经推理链传导&lt;br/&gt;C→r→y 成立: 忠实]&#10;  G --&gt;|几乎不变| I[效应走旁路&lt;br/&gt;C→y 主导: 事后合理化]\">flowchart TD\n  A[输入含关键因素 X] --&gt; B[前向计算至推理链位置]\n  B --&gt; C[推理链激活 h_r]\n  A --&gt; D[旁路: X 直接影响后层]\n  C --&gt; E[最终答案 logit y]\n  D --&gt; E\n  F[干预: 把 h_r 替换为对照值] --&gt; C\n  E --&gt; G{y 变化大吗?}\n  G --&gt;|变化大| H[效应经推理链传导&lt;br/&gt;C→r→y 成立: 忠实]\n  G --&gt;|几乎不变| I[效应走旁路&lt;br/&gt;C→y 主导: 事后合理化]</pre><p>这套设计的力量在于，它能区分扰动测试无法区分的两种情形：一段推理即便改写后答案会变（扰动测试判为&quot;忠实&quot;），也可能只是因为改写顺带扰动了旁路信息；而因果中介分析通过精确锁定推理链位置的激活，能把这种假象戳破。这也是为什么面对高风险判断时，不能止步于黑盒扰动，必须动用白盒干预。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价-前提与陷阱\">代价、前提与陷阱</h2><p>因果干预的严格性有对应的代价，必须清楚它的适用条件。</p>\n<p>第一，它需要白盒权限——能读写模型内部激活。对闭源 API 模型无法实施，这是它相对 <a href=\"perturbation-tests\">扰动测试</a> 的最大限制，也决定了它更多用于研究和内部审计而非大规模在线监控。第二，它面临&quot;离流形&quot;（off-distribution）风险：把激活替换成人为构造的对照值，可能把模型推到它从未见过的内部状态，产生的输出变化不代表自然行为。缓解办法是让对照值来自真实输入而非凭空构造。第三，规模化困难——逐位置补丁的计算量随模型层数与序列长度爆炸，因此才有归因补丁这类用梯度近似的加速手段，代价是精度下降。第四，结果解读需谨慎：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 大只说明该位置有因果影响，不直接等于&quot;人类能读懂的那步推理在起作用&quot;——激活承载的可能是分布式的、不对应任何可读语义的表示，这一点与 <a href=\"../../mechanistic-interpretability/foundations/features-representations\">机制可解释性 · 特征与表示</a> 里的叠加与多义性问题相通。</p>\n<p>正因这些代价，实践中因果干预与扰动测试是互补的：用便宜的扰动测试做规模化初筛，锁定可疑样本；再对高风险样本动用昂贵的因果干预下机制层定论。第三章最后一篇 <a href=\"faithfulness-metrics\">度量指标</a> 会把两类方法的产出统一成可报告、可比较的量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>因果干预改动内部激活而非文字，把证据从相关（行为层）提升到因果（机制层）。</li>\n<li>激活补丁测单点因果贡献，因果中介分析区分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\to r\\to y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\to y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 旁路，归因补丁用梯度近似做规模化定位。</li>\n<li>它能戳破扰动测试的假象（改写顺带扰动旁路），是高风险判断的必要武器。</li>\n<li>代价是需白盒权限、有离流形风险、规模化难、且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 大不等于对应可读语义；宜与扰动测试互补使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>便宜的黑盒对照见 <a href=\"perturbation-tests\">扰动测试</a>；两类结果的指标化见 <a href=\"faithfulness-metrics\">度量指标</a>。</li>\n<li>它主要用来坐实的现象见 <a href=\"../unfaithfulness/post-hoc-rationalization\">事后合理化</a> 与 <a href=\"../unfaithfulness/hidden-reasoning\">隐藏推理</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：底层技术见 <a href=\"../../mechanistic-interpretability/methods/activation-patching\">机制可解释性 · 激活补丁</a> 与 <a href=\"../../mechanistic-interpretability/foundations/features-representations\">机制可解释性 · 特征与表示</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"因果干预：改动激活，追踪信息流向","id":"因果干预-改动激活-追踪信息流向"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从相关到因果","id":"核心概念-从相关到因果"},{"level":2,"text":"三种主流干预手段","id":"三种主流干预手段"},{"level":2,"text":"一次因果中介实验的结构","id":"一次因果中介实验的结构"},{"level":2,"text":"代价、前提与陷阱","id":"代价-前提与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"扰动测试：改动推理，看答案会不会动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/chain-of-thought-faithfulness/measurement/perturbation-tests"},"next":{"title":"度量指标：把实验压成可报告的数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/chain-of-thought-faithfulness/measurement/faithfulness-metrics"}}